  "summary": {
    "en": "Militant groups linked to ISIS are advancing in Cabo Delgado, directly threatening the region's gas project. An Irish survivor of a recent massacre gave testimony at an inquest, describing attacks on civilians. Médecins Sans Frontières reported an attack on a medical centre and called for protection of health facilities. The insurgency’s lethality remains evident, with 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.",
